WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.390
Belgrade is getting four new city lines.

2
00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:21.460
From 1 November four new bus lines will connect more parts of Belgrade with the Expo 2027 complex in Surčin: Expo 2 from the Belgrade Waterfront terminus, Expo 3 from Zemun, Expo 4 from the Vuk Monument and Expo 5 from the Ustanička terminus.

3
00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:41.500
On these routes 31 eco-buses will run with departures every 15 to 22 minutes, and from April and May 2027 a further expansion of the network to a total of 10 lines is planned, including links to the airport, the railway station, Belville and Block 45.
